{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37446","headline":"寄怀 · 唐彦谦","name":"寄怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有客伤春复怨离，夕阳亭畔草青时。\n泪从红蜡无由制，肠比朱弦恐更危。\n梅向好风惟是笑，柳因微雨不胜垂。\n双溪未去饶归梦，夜夜孤眠枕独欹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}